    <Description>   Just a Macro that uses Electro-Pierce, Slash and Shuriken, Venom is better since it builds poisob stacks to use electro pierce faster.

   But depending on your ping u might want to use (F) since this buld is more to the high ping players, lighting crash has long animation so when your ping is low it's a good skill since it deals high damage, but for those that have high ping is just an stone on the way of attack speed!</Description>
